          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Freeze Shell"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(cold, manipulate)\n\nThe ledalusca freezes their surface into a translucent, faintly colored ice sculpture matching the mirror image of a Medium creature or object they have seen before. While in this form, instead of a wave, they have the following Strike: Melee 1A ice shell +10, Damage 1d6+4 physical plus 1d4 cold The physical damage is a type that matches the new shape of the ledalusca's frozen shell. The ledalusca can revert to their liquid form by taking this action again."
            },
